    "Hi! Just a quick reminder: You still have my “%1$@”. It was due back on %2$@. When would be a good time to return it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hi! Kurze Erinnerung: Du hast noch mein „%1$@“. Die Rückgabe war für den %2$@ geplant. Wann passt es dir, es zurückzugeben?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi! Just a quick reminder: You still have my “%1$@”. We planned for it to be returned on %2$@. Does that still work for you?" : {
